== Notes ==

* This spell bypasses immunity to mind-affecting spells. (It would be useless otherwise, since undead typically have that immunity.)
* Dominated creatures are [[associate]]s and increase the PC's [[party size penalty]] for [[experience point]]s.
* Due to a .2da bug, ''sunbeam'' is not an additional [[counterspell]] of this spell.

